<description>&lt;p&gt;Communal clashes continue across South Sudan, with SPLA-IO forces retaking Akobo after a dawn clash that left many dead and wounded, and SSPDF soldiers wounded in an assault on a Mundri West military outpost. In Unity State, fighting between SPLA-IO and government forces raised the death toll to 29, while SSPDF reported 40 deaths in Rumbek clashes, contradicting the ministry's figure of 71. A high court in Juba sentenced five officers to 24 years for raiding a general's home, and a pastor received death threats in a refugee camp. The lethal communal violence now far exceeds the 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPV3c5dVRRcDBQSkl3azc5Z2drTTFlMjFCYllTY3ZTY0JST3g0bjlVb2VKYkRzMHdwbkNuZXVDTUJ2ZkNCS1FBeERoMFh5UUo5cFBCdTMyWmVBQlE1Slp5M251SEhjV0hkbk9lMFdrSDFOMWlOY1pnQmFvaEJXaEExaTdmSjhLdVpRblp4YU5paWc0VzA?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOM0YtNEVQN1RvMDA3R2NJR3JtV2ZvVGpZR3dZWHhEdFpDS29rOTBXU1hhdWp1alVHSFJlcHpYNlhqOElJVTlGT0pwRE9jdndScEp5a1pwUDNmaXcwcnlYVWpxb1VKOFh1VFFpbFoxYnRsa3R5VkhVa1pwV0JDV1NYY0xvUmpCNU1nSWxQYkNMQTdCM2Q4Zm5qSjVmVXE?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxQSzdWOFExWmRkUEwxWDA5QnlEQ0xzdzUxaG5ZcUJYUzdlcnpPQk4tdnhFMDQzVjhqblRhV2Nta0o2dm42cTVYdmJVLUhfNi05SjhjUzRhUy0zQ1J4Z0hKRmo1ZEoyYlQtZ3k2MnBTWVBhb2lXa0xxdHpPdkNnQ0U1TG9vRDYyYXA1UjV4blRmZmJtZU5rTEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Medafrica Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxNZ0l1NTJiOUtkUkIxSE52U1gzM0syMDBkamNBa2g2QmFhU3o2QzQxVUl0T3U1THpMUjNQUmpkV1ppNzlUUWo4eksyWnYtVVc0ZkEya0E2cE9jck1CakVZT29VUm9RRm13S0RYNDk1NU5UdTRHY1pUT0cxMl9ITy1OdmEzWlNpVmNvYmw2LQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Pulitzer Center&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a hre